stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ScopeTriage: Step 0 Rank Entry Points by Blast Radius
    ScopeTriage --> PickCandidate: Select Entry Point or Rule Hit

    state AuditProcedure {
        [*] --> Facts: Step 1 Observed Facts (file:line, AST, CFG)
        Facts --> Boundaries: Step 2 Transaction, Locks & Async Scopes
        Boundaries --> Reconstruct: Step 3 Intended vs Adversarial Paths
        Reconstruct --> Degradation: Step 4 Swallows, Defaults & Floating Tasks
        Degradation --> Trust: Step 5 Ingress Caller-Controlled State
        Trust --> FailurePoint: Step 6 Map Invariant Breach & Classify
    }

    PickCandidate --> AuditProcedure
    AuditProcedure --> EvidenceGate: Evaluate Trace Against Evidence Levels

    EvidenceGate --> ConfirmedProof: Provable Invariant Breach
    EvidenceGate --> NonLiquet: Indeterminate Path (Telemetry Gap)
    EvidenceGate --> RuledOut: Verified Guard Prevents Path

    ConfirmedProof --> FindingArtifact: Step 7 Reproducer & Emit [FINDING-XXX]
    NonLiquet --> TelemetrySpec: Emit [NON-LIQUET-XXX] Telemetry Spec
    RuledOut --> CoverageNote: Record Verified Guard under Coverage

    FindingArtifact --> LoopCheck
    TelemetrySpec --> LoopCheck
    CoverageNote --> LoopCheck

    LoopCheck --> PickCandidate: More Entry Points in Scope
    LoopCheck --> ReportDeliverable: Scope Completed or Stop Condition
    ReportDeliverable --> [*]
